# Charged ollie, Double Kickflip (J + left, then J again: the THPS double tap) right after the pop: the flip finishes and the
# combo lands (the view's flip review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/flips.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+left 96
tap flip 99
run 300
expect event trickStart{trick=Double Kickflip} within 100..100
expect event trickEnd{trick=Double Kickflip} within 120..175
expect event comboLanded{name=Double Kickflip,points=300} within 160..240
expect no event bail
